id: poko-priest-maneuver
name: Poko Priest
type: standard
actionCost: 2
kiCostPerBaseTier: 5
attacking: false
requiresTarget: false
usageLimit: 1/round
fromTrait: poko-priest
fromEffect: 4
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Spirit of Namek's Poko Priest: a Minion created - a Namekian with the Dark Vassal Factor and 2(bT) more Attribute Points.
text: >
  (4)-[1/Round]: Poko Priest - As a Standard Action with an Action Cost of 2 and a Ki Point Cost of 5(bT), create a Minion. This Minion is of the Namekian Race and must possess the Dark Vassal Factor. In addition, that Minion gains 2(bT) Attribute Points to spend at Character Creation.

---

# Owned by every character, listed while the Poko Priest Option is had. Its Actions and Ki paid and its card posted; the
# Minion is the table's - Minions, and the Dark Vassal Factor, are not in this system yet.
